### ti-ai-question-ui — manual API testing via ti-gateway-api
### Requires ti-gateway-api running on :8080, routed to ti-document-worker (:8086)
### and ti-document-agent (:8087). These are the exact paths src/services/rest.service.ts calls.

@gateway = http://localhost:8080

### Upload a document file — starts async ETL (embeddings + text sections)
POST {{gateway}}/rest/v1/document/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="java.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./java.pdf
--WebAppBoundary--

###

### Load a document from a URL — starts the same async ETL pipeline
POST {{gateway}}/rest/v1/document/load-url
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com/spring-boot.pdf"
}

###

### List uploaded documents
GET {{gateway}}/rest/v1/document-agent/documents
Accept: application/json

###

### Generate questions from a document (replace 101 with a real document id from the list above)
POST {{gateway}}/rest/v1/document-agent/documents/101/question-generation
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "userMessage": "Generate questions about the compliance obligations described in this document.",
  "requestedQuestionCount": 3
}

###
